<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Boustead year net down 13 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Boustead year net down 13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)	42.9    vs	49.0</p>
<p>    Net profit		 116.66   vs     133.49</p>
<p>    Turnover		   843.83   vs     717.27</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   204.55   vs     202.04</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less   25.98   vs less 28.80</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   19.62   vs	 5.61</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)    22.5    vs	22.5</p>
<p>Note - Full name of the company is Boustead Holdings Bhd. It is involved in plantations, trading, financial services and property development.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
